	(text "REGULATOR NOTES (TPS62933F SLUSEA4D, TPS7A8300 SBVS197F)\n- FB: VOUT = 0.8 V x (1 + Rtop/Rbot). BUCK301 60.4k/10.0k = 5.63 V; BUCK302 31.6k/10.0k = 3.33 V (TI start 10.2k).\n- fSW: RT from Eq. 2, fSW = 17293 x RT^-0.942. BUCK302 RT 20.5k = 1.0 MHz.\n  BUCK301: Eq. 10 VIN_MIN = VOUT / (1 - fSW x tOFF_MIN 140 ns) = 6.51 V at 1 MHz > 6.2 V, so 1 MHz fails.\n  With losses D = (5.63 + 1.0 x (32m + 85m)) / (6.2 - 76m + 32m) = 0.934 -> fSW <= 474 kHz. RT 51.1k = 425 kHz (Dmax 0.940).\n- L: Eq. 16 at VIN 8.8 V. BUCK301 10 uH (K 0.48 at 8.8 V, 0.32 at 7.4 V; chosen for low DCR at 6.2 V dropout),\n  peak 1.24 A, Isat 3.5 A. BUCK302 6.8 uH at 1 MHz: K 0.38, peak 0.95 A, Isat 3 A.\n- SS: tSS = CSS x 0.8 V / 5.5 uA: 22n -> 3.2 ms. BST 100n 50V. CIN 10u 25V + 100n. COUT 2 x 22u 25V 1206.\n- LDOs (U303-U306): VIN +VPRE 5.63 V, BIAS open, NR/SS 10n, CIN 10u + 100n, COUT 47u 10V (>= 10 uF effective).\n  Adjustable (5.0 V, range 0.8-5.0 V): R1 105k / R2 20.0k 0.1% (DS Table 3), Vout = 0.8 x (1 + 105/20) = 5.00 V,\n  divider current 40 uA (> 5 uA). CFF 10n FB-OUT. ANY-OUT pins open, SNS open.\n  LDO305: ANY-OUT 1.6 V + 800 mV + 100 mV to GND (0.8 + 2.5 = 3.3 V, max 3.95 V), SNS to OUT, CFF 10n (DS low-noise).\n  PG open-drain to test pads only (add a probe pull-up); DS: CFF may disrupt PG.\n- LDO305 dissipation (5.63 - 3.3) V x 0.2 A = 0.47 W: thermal vias to L2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "94a8a0c0-1bc9-5126-a155-f650a36205e5")
	)
